OL,5,G2200 Battlefront: WWII Road to Victory
OL,6,     FIn 1944, U.S. forces fought a
OL,7,     Fbrutal battle to seize a coral
OL,8,     Fisland in the Kwajalein Atoll from
OL,9,     Fentrenched Japanese troops,
OL,10,     Fsecuring a vital South Pacific
OL,11,     Fmilitary base.
OL,12,G2230 Battlefront: WWII Road to Victory
OL,13,     FAs the United States prepared for
OL,14,     Fthe invasion of the Philippines,
OL,15,     Fscheduled for late 1944, the tiny
OL,16,     FPalau Islands had to be taken
OL,17,     Ffirst.
