OL,5,G2300 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FVera is concerned about the risks
OL,7,     Fof having Debbie inside Wentworth.
OL,8,     FGeoff pulls a gun on Jim. On her
OL,9,     Fday out, Lizzie collects for the
OL,10,     FSalvation Army.
OL,11,G0005 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,12,     FCops hunt for Geoff. Michael is
OL,13,     Farrested and taken off to a
OL,14,     Fpsychiatric hospital. Kerry
OL,15,     FVincent arrives in Wentworth. The
OL,16,     Fmoney Lizzie stole from the
OL,17,     FSalvation Army is found on her.
