OL,5,G0105 Dogs Behaving (Very) Badly
OL,6,     FIn Graeme Hall's first case he
OL,7,     Fturns marriage counsellor to break
OL,8,     Fup a furry love triangle. And at a
OL,9,     Fretirement home for rescue dogs, a
OL,10,     Fresident Romanian bites the hand
OL,11,     Fthat feeds him.
OL,12,G0205 Dogs Behaving (Very) Badly
OL,13,     FGraeme Hall meets Toy Poodle Ralph
OL,14,     Fwho, after being hit by a car, has
OL,15,     Ffallen out with owner Karina. And
OL,16,     Fnoisy wire-haired Dachshund Tulah
OL,17,     Fclucks like a chicken on every car
OL,18,     Ftrip!
